fted no one wanted let's say the  majority of Russians didn't want to  fight in this war  um so it has destabilized Russia  domestically  the fact that it's not only a partial  mobilization but that basically every  Russian family can be affected because  there are no clear criteria  um has brought the war home for many  Russian families and we do see a lot of  outrage we do see an attempt by the  Russian Administration and by the local  and Regional government to calm down the  population but it is some it is perhaps  the most far-reaching step that the  Russian president has forced upon his  population so far Liana fix from the  Council on Foreign Relations in  Washington D.C thanks so much for your  time  thank you

